Your photographer is with you for every function, so choose carefully. Ask these ten questions, and compare the answers. Here are ours.

1. **What exactly is included in the price?** Ask for a written list. Ours is on the [packages page](/packages), line by line.
2. **Is candid photography included, and for which days?** With us: the wedding day from Gold upwards, every function in Exclusive.
3. **Do we get all the photos, or only selected ones?** You get every photo in full resolution on a pendrive.
4. **How many people will come on the day?** It depends on the package. Diamond and above add extra cameramen.
5. **Will you fly a drone, and do you check permissions?** Yes, from Platinum. We check venue rules and restricted zones before the day.
6. **When will we get everything?** Teaser and highlights in 1–2 weeks, the full gallery in 4–6 weeks, the film and album 8–12 weeks after you pick your photos and songs.
7. **How much is the booking amount, and is it refundable?** 25%, non-refundable. With more than 60 days' notice you can move your booking to a new date once. See the [cancellation policy](/cancellation-policy).
8. **Can we see a full real album, not just highlights?** Visit our studio on Delhi Road, Rohtak, and see real albums.
9. **Will our photos be posted online?** Only if you agree. See our [privacy policy](/privacy).
10. **What if you can't make it?** If we cancel, you get 100% of your money back.

Ready to compare? [Build your quote](/build) in a minute.
